-- title:
--   Local constancy and measurability of the Iwasawa shell index
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ be a number field (a field with a `NumberField` instance) and let $v$ be a height-one prime of the ring of integers $\mathcal{O}_K$. Consider the integer-valued function `iwasawaShellIndex K v` on $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{A}_K)$, the group of units of the ring of $2\times 2$ matrices over the adele ring of $\mathcal{O}_K$ in $K$: for $g$ in this group it is $$2\,\mathrm{log}\bigl(\max(|g_{10}|_v,|g_{11}|_v)\bigr)-\mathrm{log}\,|\det g|_v,$$ where for an entry of $g$ one takes its finite-adelic component at $v$ and applies the canonical valuation of the completion at $v$, with values in $\mathrm{WithZero}(\mathrm{Multiplicative}\ \mathbb{Z})$, and likewise for the adelic determinant of $g$ viewed as an element of the adele ring; $\mathrm{log}$ denotes the $\mathbb{Z}$-valued logarithm `WithZero.log` on that value group. The theorem asserts the conjunction: this function is locally constant on $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{A}_K)$, and it is measurable for the Borel $\sigma$-algebra [`NumberField.AdelicHaar.glBorel`](def/NumberField_AdelicHaar.html#L176) generated by the topology of $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{A}_K)$ (installed as a local instance together with the corresponding `BorelSpace` instance).
--
--   The function in question records, at the finite place $v$, the exponent $m_v(g)$ in the Iwasawa-type relation $|\det g|_v = \max(|c|_v,|d|_v)^2 \cdot |\varpi_v|_v^{m_v(g)}$ for the bottom row $(c,d)$ of $g$; local constancy makes the level sets $\{m_v = n\}$ open and measurable, so that $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{A}_K)$ decomposes into measurable "shells". It is used in the Rankin–Selberg unfolding computations, namely in the shell recursion for quotient integrals and in the evaluation of the integral over the shell-zero part against the rational-centre unipotent quotient measure.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AutomorphicForm_isLocallyConstant_iwasawaShellIndex_and_measurable.lean

import Definitions.Def_AutomorphicForm_IwasawaShellIndex
import Definitions.Def_NumberField_AdelicHaar

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

open NumberField IsDedekindDomain AutomorphicForm

attribute [local instance] NumberField.AdelicHaar.glBorel NumberField.AdelicHaar.borelSpace_glBorel

theorem AutomorphicForm.isLocallyConstant_iwasawaShellIndex_and_measurable
    (K : Type) [Field K] [NumberField K] (v : HeightOneSpectrum (𝓞 K)) :
    IsLocallyConstant (iwasawaShellIndex K v) ∧ Measurable (iwasawaShellIndex K v) := by sorry
